{'symbol': 'RCL', 'date': '2023-02-15 09:00:00', 'title': 'CELEBRITY CRUISES BECOMES THE FIRST CRUISE LINE TO EVER EARN THE COVETED FORBES TRAVEL GUIDE AWARD', 'text': 'CELEBRITY SHIPS RECOGNIZED IN A LEAGUE OF THEIR OWN AS "RESORTS AT SEA," IN A BRAND-NEW OCEAN CRUISE RATINGS CATEGORY MIAMI , FEB. 15, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- CELEBRITY CRUISES , THE BRAND THAT REVOLUTIONIZED THE CRUISING INDUSTRY WITH ITS FLEET OF RELAXED LUXURYSM RESORTS AT SEA, IS ONCE AGAIN RAISING THE BAR AS IT BECOMES THE FIRST OCEAN CRUISE LINE TO EVER EARN PRESTIGIOUS\xa0FORBES TRAVEL GUIDE\xa0("FTG") STAR AWARDS. THE RECOGNITION IS MADE MORE WONDERFUL AS CELEBRITY\'S SHIPS JOIN AN ELITE AND EXCLUSIVE GROUP OF FEWER THAN 20 LAND-BASED PROPERTIES WITH OVER 1,000 ROOMS IN THE WORLD TO EVER RECEIVE THE COVETED RECOGNITION.'}